      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems like the crashing on Quest tends to happen the most when someone either joins the world or changes avatars. Instead of crashing to the Quest home like it used to, the game freezes and repeats the last 10 seconds or so of audio. If the game is closed during a crash, it usually says in the Quest home that there was not enough memory to run vrchat. If joining a world with a large amount of people, I usually get kicked back to my home world with vrchat saying it ran out of memory.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
