      "value": "@{5f2d9c298950d37cd07f2a5b|full_name}: Chances are this ticket was tracking some performance regressions we had around April of this year. Unity 2022 has only caused an increase in performance, according to our investigations!\n\nIf you have any idea of specific instances where perf got worse though, we'll happily dig into them. There's always a chance something got missed.\n\nOne known thing that should be getting better was load time for some very specific worlds - that should be improving as people reupload with the newer SDK.",
